  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi"><head>ΣΚΥΡΙΑΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="496" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-496" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi">
            <note>"Notum argumentum fabulæ. Vide Hyginum cap. XCVI. et Philostrati junioris iconem, cui titulus Achilles in Scyro p. 863, ubi Sophoclei dramatis meminit : Σκῦρος, νῆσος, ἣν ὁ θεῖος Σοφοκλῆς ἀνεμώδεα καλεῖ." BRUNCK.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="497" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-497" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi">
            <note type="source">Plutarchus Moral. p. 34 d.</note>
            <quote>Τὴν δὲ πρὸς τὸν Ἀχιλλέα τὸν ἐν Σκύρῳ καθήμενον ἐν ταῖς παρθένοις γεγενημένην ἐπίπληξιν ὑπὸ τοῦ Ὀδυσσέως</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Σὺ δ᾽ ὦ τὸ λαμπρὸν φῶς ἀποσβεννὺς γένους,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ξαίνεις, ἀρίστου πατρὸς Ἑλλήνων γεγώς;</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Iterum hos versus affert Plutarchus p. 72 e, præmissis verbis, Ὁ ἐν τοῖς Σκυρίοις Ὀδυσσεύς. Ubi καταισχύνων pro ἀποσβεννύς scriptum.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="498" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-498" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:510">
            <note type="source">Stobæus LI, 24.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Φιλεῖ γὰρ ἄνδρας πόλεμος ἀγρεύειν νέους.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="499" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-499" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:511">
            <note type="source">Stobæus LIX, 3.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οἱ ποντοναῦται τῶν ταλαιπώρων βροτῶν,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">οἷς οὔτε δαίμων οὔτε τις θεῶν νέμων</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">πλούτου ποτ᾽ ἂν νείμειεν ἀξίαν χάριν,</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">λεπταῖς ἐπὶ ῥοπαῖσιν ἐμπολὰς μακρὰς</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">ἀεὶ παραρρίπτοντες οἱ πολύφθοροι</l>
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">ἢ ᾽σωσαν, ἢ ᾽κέρδαναν, ἢ διώλεσαν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="500" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-500" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXVI, 28. Σοφοκλέους Σκυρίων</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐδὲν γὰρ ἄλγος οἷον ἡ πολλὴ ζόη.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Hunc versum duo alii sequuntur sine lemmate,</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Πάντ᾽ ἐμπέφυκε τῷ μακρῷ γήρᾳ κακὰ,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">νοῦς φροῦδος, ἔργ᾽ ἀχρεῖα, φροντίδες κεναί.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Versum alterum ex Sophocle affert Clemens Alex. p. 73, ὦτ᾽ ἀχρεῖα exhibens.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="501" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-501" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:513">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXXIV, 17.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ εἰ μὲν ἦν κλαίουσιν ἰᾶσθαι κακὰ,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">καὶ τὸν θανόντα δακρύοις ἀνιστάναι,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ὁ χρυσὸς ἦσσον κτῆμα τοῦ κλαίειν ἂν ἦν.</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">νῦν δ᾽, ὦ γεραιὲ, ταῦτ᾽ ἀνηνύτως ἔχει,</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">τὸν μὲν τάφῳ κρυφθέντα πρὸς τὸ φῶς ἄγειν·</l>
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">κἀμοὶ γὰρ ἂν πατήρ γε δακρύων χάριν</l>
              <l n="7" xml:lang="grc">ἀνῆκτ᾽ ἂν εἰς φῶς.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="502" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-502" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:514">
            <note type="source">Hesychius</note>
            <quote>Ἀποστιβής (codex ἀποστίβ··)· ἀποπεφοιτηκώς. οὐ τὴν αὐτὴν τρίβον στείβων, τουτέστ φοιτῶν. Σ. Σκυρίαις.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="503" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-503" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:515">
            <note type="source">Hesychius</note>
            <quote>Αὐτόσσυτον αὐτοκέλευστον, Σ. Σκυρίαις.</quote>
            <note>Omisso nomine fabulæ grammaticus Bekkeri p. 467, 31.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="504" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-504" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:516">
            <note type="source">Hesychius</note>
            <quote>Ἀχρήματον· ἀδάπανον. Σ. Σκυρίαις.</quote>
            <note>Codex ἀχρήματα.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="505" xml:id="fragment-skyrioi-dindorf1893_grc1-505" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_skyrioi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.skyrioi.nauck1889grc1:517">
            <note type="source">Hesychius</note>
            <quote>in εἴωρος—ὡς ὁ αὐτὸς (Σοφοκλῆς) ἐν Σκυρίαις χρῆται τῷ εὐωριάζειν.</quote>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
